<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WICOR Inc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WICOR Inc started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of WICOR Inc as an outperform rating.</p>
<p>Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>WICOR gained 1/4 to 39-3/8 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
